<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto"
    android:id="@+id/main"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:background="#DFF0D8"
    android:orientation="vertical">

    <!-- Fixed Header -->
    <include
        android:id="@+id/header_section"
        layout="@layout/layout_section_header"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content" />

    <!-- Scrollable Content -->
    <androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="0dp"
        android:layout_weight="1"
        android:fillViewport="true"
        android:padding="16dp">

        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:orientation="vertical">

            <!-- Grading System Section -->
            <LinearLayout
                android:orientation="vertical"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:padding="16dp"
                android:layout_marginBottom="16dp"
                android:background="@drawable/rounded_corners"
                android:gravity="center_horizontal">

                <!-- Title -->
                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/grading_title"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:text="Grading System"
                    android:textColor="#064c24"
                    android:textSize="20sp"
                    android:textStyle="bold"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/montserrat_extra_bold"
                    android:layout_marginBottom="8dp"
                    android:gravity="center"/>

                <!-- Instruction Text -->
                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/grading_text"
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:textColor="#064c24"
                    android:textSize="14sp"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/montserrat_medium"
                    android:lineSpacingExtra="6dp"
                    android:textAlignment="textStart"
                    android:text="The academic performance of the student shall be rated using the following grading system:" />

                <!-- Grading Table Wrapper with border -->
                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
                    android:layout_marginEnd="8dp"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border">

                    <!-- Grading Table -->
                    <TableLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:stretchColumns="*"
                        android:layout_margin="0dp">

                        <!-- Header Row -->
                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView
                                android:text="GRADE"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:padding="8dp"
                                android:textColor="#064c24"
                                android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView
                                android:text="EQUIVALENT"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:padding="8dp"
                                android:textColor="#064c24"
                                android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <!-- Grade Rows -->
                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="1.00" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="97 – 100%" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="1.25" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="94 – 96%" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="1.50" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="91 – 93%" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="1.75" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="88 – 90%" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="2.00" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="85 – 87%" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="2.25" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="82 – 84%" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="2.50" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="79 – 81%" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="2.75" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="76 – 78%" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="3.00" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="75% (Passed)" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="4.00" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="Conditional Passed" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="5.00" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="Failed" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="Inc." android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="Incomplete" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="D" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView android:text="Officially Dropped" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                        </TableRow>

                        <TableRow>
                            <TextView android:text="FDA / UD" android:padding="8dp" android:textColor="#064c24" android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"/>
                            <TextView
                                android:text="Failure Due to Absences / Unofficially Dropped"
                                android:padding="8dp"
                                android:textColor="#064c24"
                                android:background="@drawable/table_cell_border"
                                android:layout_width="0dp"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_weight="1"
                                android:ellipsize="none"
                                android:scrollHorizontally="false"
                                android:singleLine="false"/>
                        </TableRow>
                    </TableLayout>
                </LinearLayout>

                <!-- Notes -->
                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/grading_notes"
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:textColor="#064c24"
                    android:textSize="14sp"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/montserrat_medium"
                    android:lineSpacingExtra="6dp"
                    android:textAlignment="textStart"
                    android:layout_marginTop="12dp"
                    android:text="4.00 (Conditional Passed) indicates that there is a slight deficiency in the
performance of the student to satisfy the minimum requirements of the course for
him to earn the lowest passing grade of '3'. The student, in consultation with
the subject teacher concerned, must resolve this deficiency within two (2) weeks
after he/she received the grade; otherwise the grade automatically becomes '5.00'.
The grade of 4.00 shall not appear in the student’s permanent records or
transcript of records.\n\n

Inc. (Incomplete) indicates that the student has been getting passing marks in all
criteria for grading except that he lacks certain project or activity required in the
course. The student has a grace period of one (1) year to complete the
requirements; otherwise, 'Inc.' automatically becomes '5.00'. If the student got
the mark of 'Inc.' in a prerequisite subject, he may not enroll in the subject in
which it is a prerequisite until he has completed such prerequisite subject.\n\n

D (Officially Dropped) indicates that the student officially filled a formal
dropping form, duly signed by the respective instructor/professor, dean, and the
university registrar.\n\n

FDA or UD (Failure Due to Absences or Unofficially Dropped) indicates that
the student discontinued attending the class without notice to the teacher
concerned, resulting in failure or unofficially dropping the subject."/>

            </LinearLayout>

        </LinearLayout>
    </androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView>

    <!-- Fixed Logos at Bottom -->
    <LinearLayout
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginVertical="10dp"
        android:gravity="center"
        android:orientation="horizontal">

        <ImageView
            android:layout_width="50dp"
            android:layout_height="50dp"
            android:layout_marginEnd="16dp"
            android:contentDescription="Bustos Logo"
            android:src="@drawable/bustos_logo" />

        <ImageView
            android:layout_width="50dp"
            android:layout_height="50dp"
            android:contentDescription="Eagles Logo"
            android:src="@drawable/eagles_logo" />
    </LinearLayout>

</LinearLayout>
